message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the upstream sources listed in SOURCES.csv where relevant."
type: dataset
title: "U.S. county-level election results: President, U.S. House and U.S. Senate, 1990-2024"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22976553
authors:
  - family-names: Heideman
    given-names: Paul
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/pmheideman/us-county-election-results"
url: "https://pmheideman.shinyapps.io/us-county-election-results/"
abstract: >-
  Candidate-level county results for U.S. House (1990-2024), President (1992-2024) and U.S. Senate (1990-2024)
  general elections in the 48 contiguous states, assembled from state election offices, MEDSL, OpenElections and
  Algara & Amlani, with every source, correction and coverage gap documented.
keywords:
  - elections
  - county
  - U.S. House
  - congressional elections
  - presidential elections
  - Senate elections
